list.add(12);
//1.编译期间直接添加会报错
list.add("a");
Class<? extends List> clazz = list.getClass();
Method add = clazz.getDeclaredMethod("add", Object.class);
//2.运行期间通过反射添加，是可以的
add.invoke(list, "kl");

System.out.println(list)
```

